          "type": "Text",
          "format": "html",
          "text": [
            "<p>The last part of each lesson is the &quot;Evaluate&quot; section.</p><p>Science and engineering aren&#x27;t about figuring everything out all at once, it&#x27;s about making incremental progress: making smaller improvements over time to design a big project that actually <em>works</em>.</p><p>After you develop something, you&#x27;ll spend some time evaluating it: What worked? What didn&#x27;t? Why? What are your next steps?</p>"
          ]
